WEBVTT

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:21.110
Damn! Why did things turn out this way?

00:00:21.110 --> 00:00:22.100
The Principality of Gallia...

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:24.690
Didn't we have them suppressed in the summer?

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:42.130
T-That's a Valkyria!

00:00:59.420 --> 00:01:03.800
Chapter 23

00:00:59.420 --> 00:01:03.800
Form of Love

00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:05.170
So...

00:01:05.170 --> 00:01:07.010
What're you going to do?

00:01:07.010 --> 00:01:09.670
Central is labeling you a traitor. {treachery, betrayal}

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:15.950
I thought you were smarter than this.

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:18.870
Nothing good will come out of...

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:21.890
...opposing them, right?

00:01:21.890 --> 00:01:23.980
You don't understand, Jaeger?

00:01:24.670 --> 00:01:27.830
I'm no longer a part of the Empire.

00:01:27.830 --> 00:01:32.150
I'm the ruler of my own nation.

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:35.170
Is it because of that previous report?

00:01:35.170 --> 00:01:36.950
"The Illusionary Beast?"

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:42.030
I have no need for this dirty title of Second Crown Prince anymore.

00:01:42.030 --> 00:01:43.480
Hey, hey.

00:01:43.480 --> 00:01:46.900
Then what about me, who followed you because of that title?

00:01:46.900 --> 00:01:48.530
You chose to do that.

00:01:48.530 --> 00:01:50.630
Not me.

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:53.800
You're right.

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:55.210
That's exactly right.

00:01:56.110 --> 00:01:57.770
How's Selvaria?

00:01:57.770 --> 00:02:00.050
She said she wasn't feeling too well.

00:02:00.490 --> 00:02:04.130
She has remained in bed these past few days.

00:02:04.130 --> 00:02:05.270
I see.

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:08.360
I bet you haven't gone to visit her even once.

00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:09.480
There's no need.

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:13.400
My, my. You're so cold.

00:02:24.840 --> 00:02:28.500
I've sent in a request for you to visit with her as well.

00:02:29.090 --> 00:02:30.860
Thank you very much.

00:02:30.860 --> 00:02:34.780
The guys up top are probably trying to obtain all the credit.

00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:38.820
They're desperately trying to get rid of people like us who share a past with her.

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:53.940
"A Look Into The Valkyrur's Past."

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:56.660
"The Riddle behind the Barious Faith." {Barious = name of that famous temple with Valkyrian history. -Ky}

00:02:56.660 --> 00:02:59.770
Everything's related to the Valkyrur.

00:03:09.610 --> 00:03:10.950
Faldio's...

00:03:10.950 --> 00:03:14.130
Yeah. I think he's probably in pain too.

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:18.470
Every book here embodies his hesitation and frustration.

00:03:20.740 --> 00:03:24.960
I'm at fault too for not sensing his feelings earlier.

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:26.100
No...

00:03:31.910 --> 00:03:36.220
The other day, Captain Alicia Melchiott once again brought victory...

00:03:36.220 --> 00:03:40.420
...to us, the Principality of Gallia, at the northern front lines.

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:43.490
She won every battle... {Idiom: Winning battles consecutively}

00:03:43.490 --> 00:03:46.120
We would just drag her down if we went.

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:47.660
This is for the better.

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:52.880
Has she been eating properly when they've deployed her so much?

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:54.470
S-She'll be fine!

00:03:54.470 --> 00:03:57.710
They must be taking good care of her. She's probably eating well everyday.

00:03:57.710 --> 00:04:00.150
Yeah! That's definitely it!

00:04:00.150 --> 00:04:03.750
I said mean things to Alicia!

00:04:09.690 --> 00:04:12.660
We haven't received any replies to our letters from her.

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:16.310
Maybe she doesn't think of us as comrades anymore?

00:04:16.310 --> 00:04:19.280
Hey, hey. You still don't understand?

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:21.760
She isn't that kind of person.

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:24.030
Yes, Largo is right.

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:26.900
Then why doesn't she contact us?

00:04:26.900 --> 00:04:28.570
She's busy.

00:04:28.570 --> 00:04:32.460
She's being forced to fight alone, so she's exhausted.

00:04:34.820 --> 00:04:38.530
If so, how about we just go and visit her?

00:04:38.530 --> 00:04:40.170
It's that simple, isn't it?

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:44.010
Nothing will change if we just brood over things{trouble} here.

00:04:44.010 --> 00:04:47.950
Even the Commander couldn't get to her.

00:04:47.950 --> 00:04:49.200
So?

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:49.760
What's your point?

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:53.520
Even the officers are being kept away...

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:56.240
Who cares?

00:04:56.240 --> 00:04:58.230
We'll just hang around until we get to see her.

00:04:58.230 --> 00:05:00.830
Rosie, no matter what, that's-

00:05:00.830 --> 00:05:02.110
I'll go!

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:06.570
At the very least, I want to tell Alicia that we're waiting for her!

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:14.470
I'm not going to apologize to her!

00:05:14.470 --> 00:05:16.170
Don't be stubborn.

00:05:24.830 --> 00:05:27.300
Today's battle was another pushover.

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:31.610
It's like we're getting all the credit without doing anything.

00:05:31.610 --> 00:05:34.410
We're just following orders.

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:38.120
We won't be reprimanded for doing that. {If reprimanded, I won't accept it}

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:41.520
It was certainly the Valkyria who won the battle.

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:45.070
But we, Fifth Company, are the ones who command her.

00:05:45.560 --> 00:05:49.540
Princess Cordelia might even award us medals personally.

00:05:50.420 --> 00:05:52.570
Have you asked her personally?

00:05:52.570 --> 00:05:54.000
I don't have to answer that.

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:55.870
At least let us eat together!

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:56.890
No!

00:05:56.890 --> 00:06:00.290
So how's that legendary Valkyria?

00:05:57.070 --> 00:05:58.340
Please!

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:01.340
Yeah.

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:03.360
Tell us the truth about her.

00:06:05.030 --> 00:06:08.240
Although she looks like a little girl on the outside,

00:06:08.240 --> 00:06:09.260
having that kind of power...

00:06:09.690 --> 00:06:11.600
makes her seem like a monster.

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:14.600
Normal people can't imagine...

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:15.270
Hold it right there!

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:18.280
You regulars really are a bunch of bastards!

00:06:18.280 --> 00:06:19.510
Hey, you!

00:06:19.510 --> 00:06:20.440
Watch your words!

00:06:20.910 --> 00:06:23.690
What business does the militia have with us?

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:27.360
C-Could you stop insulting Alicia?

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:32.150
Oh, you guys are from her previous squad...

00:06:32.150 --> 00:06:37.290
It seems like that monster's comrades don't seem to know their place by trying to butt into our affairs.

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:41.450
It's a fight! A fight!

00:06:40.780 --> 00:06:42.080
Hey, do something!

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:44.380
They're lobbying accusations at the regulars!

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:45.670
It's some people from the militia!

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:47.510
They're that Valkyria's...

00:06:52.480 --> 00:06:53.890
Damn!

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:56.220
This is...

00:06:56.220 --> 00:06:57.600
Rosie!

00:06:57.600 --> 00:06:58.330
Oscar!

00:06:58.330 --> 00:06:59.390
Emile!

00:06:59.390 --> 00:07:01.920
Stop, everyone!

00:07:01.920 --> 00:07:03.470
Please stop!

00:07:05.730 --> 00:07:07.880
Are you their superior?

00:07:07.880 --> 00:07:08.940
Y-Yes.

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:12.280
They can be court-martialed for punching a commissioned officer!

00:07:14.570 --> 00:07:15.980
I'm very sorry!

00:07:15.980 --> 00:07:18.330
I'll punish them accordingly!

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:20.120
Please wait!

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:23.300
They made a fool out of Alicia!

00:07:23.300 --> 00:07:24.840
Yeah! We didn't do anything wrong!

00:07:25.300 --> 00:07:26.340
Both of you shut up!

00:07:31.370 --> 00:07:33.590
I don't know what you guys are bothered about,

00:07:33.590 --> 00:07:36.520
but there's nothing else good about her besides being useful in battles.

00:07:36.520 --> 00:07:38.560
That monster.

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:40.780
But then again- {II PUNCH} {PWNED NIGGUH} {IIIII NO PUNCHU!}

00:07:51.520 --> 00:07:53.410
Let me through.

00:07:53.410 --> 00:07:54.400
Yes, ma'am!

00:08:03.430 --> 00:08:05.420
2nd Lieutenant Landzaat.

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:07.380
How are you feeling?

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:09.670
I heard you haven't been sleeping.

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:11.340
I'm fine.

00:08:11.900 --> 00:08:14.130
You are now free.

00:08:15.080 --> 00:08:17.550
I won't allow anyone to complain.

00:08:17.550 --> 00:08:21.140
Thanks to you and Alicia, Gallia was saved.

00:08:23.390 --> 00:08:26.030
Could we talk a little?

00:08:26.030 --> 00:08:27.130
No.

00:08:27.130 --> 00:08:29.150
Will you listen to me?

00:08:57.040 --> 00:08:58.450
Selvaria!

00:09:05.100 --> 00:09:09.960
You know, you're the beautiful star of the Drei Stein.

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:12.670
It'll trouble us if you don't shine.

00:09:12.670 --> 00:09:15.820
All stars will go out eventually.

00:09:17.230 --> 00:09:18.410
Yeah.

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:21.920
Isn't it the end when the star stops shining?

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:26.210
I'm...

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:28.360
I'm like the moon.

00:09:28.360 --> 00:09:30.570
I can't shine without the sun.

00:09:31.480 --> 00:09:33.550
That's nonsense.

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:36.640
Actually, that's more true of me.

00:09:38.240 --> 00:09:39.790
You should know, right?

00:09:39.790 --> 00:09:42.620
My hometown was destroyed by the Empire.

00:09:42.620 --> 00:09:47.690
I felt that I'd be able to rebuild my country if I followed Maximilian.

00:09:48.160 --> 00:09:50.730
I'm a pretty selfish guy. {samoshii = selfish -Ky}

00:09:51.230 --> 00:09:52.690
Hometown...

00:09:54.460 --> 00:09:56.280
It's a nice place.

00:09:56.280 --> 00:09:57.630
The winters are tough,

00:09:57.630 --> 00:10:00.460
but the summers were breathtaking.

00:10:00.460 --> 00:10:04.200
Autumn too. I picked mushrooms with my family.

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:06.300
We'd step on the leaves.

00:10:06.300 --> 00:10:09.290
And the smell of the forest after it rained...

00:10:10.370 --> 00:10:14.310
I really want you and Maximilian to experience that too.

00:10:17.730 --> 00:10:18.760
What's wrong?

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:22.470
Thank you very much.

00:10:32.310 --> 00:10:34.870
Unbelievable! The Randgriz family's...

00:10:35.590 --> 00:10:37.480
If they wanted to pursue your crime,

00:10:37.480 --> 00:10:40.780
then I should be the one being put on trial.

00:10:42.630 --> 00:10:43.730
Even so...

00:10:43.730 --> 00:10:46.020
I can't come to a resolution.

00:10:46.740 --> 00:10:48.500
I'm really...

00:10:51.260 --> 00:10:54.090
Damn! That's why the militia is...

00:10:55.900 --> 00:10:56.960
Welkin!

00:10:58.000 --> 00:10:59.010
What's the meaning of this?

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:01.110
Princess Cordelia!

00:11:01.110 --> 00:11:04.260
This person was violent towards the company commander!

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:08.270
2nd Lieutenant Gunther is a hero who has been distinguished with medals!

00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:10.520
I won't allow anyone to show him disrespect.

00:11:10.970 --> 00:11:12.270
S-Sorry, ma'am!

00:11:20.640 --> 00:11:21.700
Welkin!

00:11:22.790 --> 00:11:24.700
Please pull yourself together!

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:28.370
What happened to you?

00:11:28.370 --> 00:11:29.940
This isn't like you.

00:11:30.470 --> 00:11:32.410
I'm pathetic.

00:11:32.410 --> 00:11:33.800
Even though you asked me...

00:11:33.800 --> 00:11:37.740
to protect Alicia...

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:48.560
This is the time to strike the final blow against the Empire!

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:53.880
Right now, their only strong point in Gallia is the fortress at Ghirlandaio.

00:11:53.880 --> 00:12:00.110
Fortunately, we have the protection of the noble and righteous Valkyria!

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:02.110
Now, Captain Melchiott.

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:04.880
Show us your resolve!

00:12:04.880 --> 00:12:08.200
A Valkyria's words will raise everyone's morale!

00:12:19.140 --> 00:12:20.610
I...

00:12:21.390 --> 00:12:24.720
I will do my best to fight.

00:12:25.170 --> 00:12:27.990
However, I just want minimum casualties.

00:12:27.990 --> 00:12:30.910
For both Gallia and the Empire.

00:12:32.530 --> 00:12:33.730
For that reason...

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:37.560
I would just like this war to end as quickly as possible.

00:12:48.820 --> 00:12:51.220
Did you hear that, Princess Cordelia?

00:12:51.220 --> 00:12:54.210
Captain Melchiott said that we can leave everything to her.

00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:57.670
She's such a reliable subordinate!

00:13:17.010 --> 00:13:19.270
How late are you planning to sleep until?

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:22.610
I made your favorite stew today.

00:13:23.630 --> 00:13:24.970
Isara...

00:13:24.970 --> 00:13:26.050
That and...

00:13:26.050 --> 00:13:27.900
Alicia's bread.

00:13:27.900 --> 00:13:30.870
Alicia... By Alicia, you mean...

00:13:30.870 --> 00:13:33.700
She baked some very tasty bread today!

00:13:34.780 --> 00:13:36.250
I see...

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:37.420
Yeah.

00:13:38.970 --> 00:13:40.250
What?

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:41.300
Because...

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:42.590
What's so funny, Isara?

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:46.510
When it comes to Alicia, you really are...

00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:48.120
What?

00:13:48.120 --> 00:13:49.950
What did you say?

00:13:56.440 --> 00:13:58.020
Commander!

00:13:58.020 --> 00:13:59.950
You're awake!

00:13:59.950 --> 00:14:01.290
You guys...

00:14:01.920 --> 00:14:03.670
I'm so glad!

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:05.950
Hey hey, nevermind if it's on the battlefield,

00:14:05.950 --> 00:14:08.420
but how could he bear losing his life in a fight?

00:14:08.420 --> 00:14:11.580
Because he was the only one who was taken away...

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:13.430
Seriously, Rosie.

00:14:13.430 --> 00:14:15.860
You picked a fight with guys like that...

00:14:15.860 --> 00:14:17.650
Yeah, I did, but...

00:14:17.650 --> 00:14:21.330
I never thought the commander would join in too.

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:24.930
According to the company commander, we won't receive any punishment.

00:14:24.930 --> 00:14:26.920
{What did he use}What the hell is going on?

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:29.590
It really is weird.

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:30.810
Okay, okay.

00:14:30.810 --> 00:14:33.470
Let the commander rest a bit more.

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:35.360
Yeah.

00:14:35.360 --> 00:14:36.150
Let's go.

00:14:36.150 --> 00:14:37.020
Largo.

00:14:38.840 --> 00:14:41.800
Did you bring me here?

00:14:41.800 --> 00:14:42.790
No.

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:45.460
The militia main office told us you were here.

00:14:45.460 --> 00:14:48.110
They told us you had been released and sent here.

00:14:48.490 --> 00:14:49.530
I see.

00:15:02.340 --> 00:15:03.670
Princess Cordelia!

00:15:03.670 --> 00:15:05.680
Good work.

00:15:12.540 --> 00:15:15.120
Please don't be so formal.

00:15:15.120 --> 00:15:18.310
Alicia, you saved my life.

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:19.440
But...

00:15:19.970 --> 00:15:25.860
No amount of medals or status can make up for what you did.

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:28.860
If there's anything you want, please tell me.

00:15:30.960 --> 00:15:32.820
Anything is fine.

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:35.950
I want to repay you.

00:15:37.860 --> 00:15:38.850
Um...

00:15:38.850 --> 00:15:40.140
Yes.

00:15:40.140 --> 00:15:41.570
There's just one thing.

00:15:41.570 --> 00:15:43.020
Of course.

00:15:43.020 --> 00:15:47.730
A very selfish, forceful, arrogant request.

00:15:47.730 --> 00:15:48.460
Go ahead.

00:15:49.470 --> 00:15:53.890
Please keep Squad 7 and Faldio safe!

00:15:55.320 --> 00:15:56.990
Somehow, when the war ends,

00:15:56.990 --> 00:16:00.100
please let everyone return to their hometowns safely.

00:16:03.660 --> 00:16:05.230
I understand.

00:16:19.150 --> 00:16:20.350
Excuse me!

00:16:20.350 --> 00:16:20.950
Captain Melchiott,

00:16:21.550 --> 00:16:23.090
everything is ready.

00:16:24.400 --> 00:16:25.170
All right.

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:52.680
You, Alicia Melchiott,

00:16:52.680 --> 00:16:56.550
I hereby name the representative of Randgriz, rulers of Gallia.

00:16:56.550 --> 00:17:02.200
I lend you this spear and shield as proof of becoming a representative of the Randgriz family.

00:17:12.430 --> 00:17:17.440
I, Alicia Melchiott, swear to work diligently as your representative.

00:17:19.930 --> 00:17:25.220
We've been tasked with rear support for the battle for Ghirlandaio.

00:17:25.220 --> 00:17:26.560
Specifically, Squad 7...

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:27.600
Yes, ma'am!

00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:31.900
Your squad is responsible for protecting Princess Cordelia.

00:17:34.520 --> 00:17:36.700
Captain, what's the meaning of this?

00:17:37.150 --> 00:17:39.480
The order was given by Princess Cordelia herself.

00:17:39.480 --> 00:17:43.310
She wants you to protect her before she returns to Randgriz Castle.

00:17:43.890 --> 00:17:47.120
For such an important mission, there should be a special-

00:17:46.270 --> 00:17:48.170
You cannot refuse this mission.

00:17:48.170 --> 00:17:48.920
Why?

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:49.830
That is all.

00:17:53.140 --> 00:17:54.210
It must have been Alicia.

00:17:55.360 --> 00:17:56.170
I don't know.

00:17:56.650 --> 00:17:58.430
Did Alicia ask the Princess to do this?

00:17:58.430 --> 00:18:01.850
We don't have the right to ask Princess Cordelia for an explanation!

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:16.220
Alicia! {Made spaces for the yells, looks better - Ryan}

00:18:16.220 --> 00:18:17.720
Alicia, where are you?!

00:18:17.720 --> 00:18:19.320
Alicia!

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:21.180
Alicia!

00:18:21.180 --> 00:18:22.970
Alicia!

00:18:22.970 --> 00:18:24.870
Alicia!

00:18:25.300 --> 00:18:27.370
Alicia!

00:18:30.320 --> 00:18:31.610
Alicia...

00:18:32.650 --> 00:18:34.130
Welkin...

00:18:35.220 --> 00:18:36.590
Alicia!

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:40.680
Don't go, Alicia!

00:18:44.910 --> 00:18:46.930
Captain Melchiott...

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:06.580
ALICIA!

00:19:15.080 --> 00:19:16.000
Your Highness.

00:19:17.110 --> 00:19:19.970
I have come to greet you before departing.

00:19:27.810 --> 00:19:29.620
This upcoming battle will...

00:19:29.620 --> 00:19:32.100
...be passed down through posterity.

00:19:35.710 --> 00:19:40.360
I, Selvaria Bles, promise you victory, Lord Maximillian.

00:19:41.520 --> 00:19:42.770
I promise.

00:20:11.010 --> 00:20:12.440
"Selvaria."

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:15.670
My name was given to me by His Highness.

00:20:15.670 --> 00:20:21.600
My existence is slight... Nothing when compared to the significance of this name.

00:20:21.600 --> 00:20:25.220
Even if I have the power of a Valkyria.

